  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20ce9f6737e6e845b50655fcc50fb57, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldLady
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Old Lady
  lines:
  - This area is dedicated to remembering Sir Linus Torvalds.
  - He was more than just the founder of the Open Source Magic Academy....
  - ....he was a great thinker and inventor.
  - He created Git, the version control system used in almost every software project
    in the world.
  - But GIt wasn't even his greatest invention, it was just a side project he made....
  - He created the Linux kernel, which is used by millions of devices today.
  - ....so that he could manage his main project -- THE LINUX KERNEL.
  - The LInux kernel is used to run millions of servers and electronic devices. Your
    TV, fridge, toaster, everything.
